OL,3,GNEWSAHow horse poo donations are       
OL,4,Ahelping canal boat repair              
OL,6,FAn historic canal dry dock has made an 
OL,7,Funusual appeal, urging people to donate
OL,8,Fhorse manure towards its latest boat   
OL,9,Frenovation project.                    
OL,11,FTooley's Boatyard, on the Oxford Canal,
OL,12,Fin Banbury, is thought to be the UK    
OL,13,Fcanal system's oldest continuously     
OL,14,Fworking dry dock.                      
OL,16,FAs part of its latest project, the     
OL,17,Fcompany is asking for people to donate 
OL,18,Fhorse manure towards the renovation on 
OL,19,Fthe historic wooden narrowboat Hardy.  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
