OL,3,GNEWSAHow horse poo donations are       
OL,4,Ahelping canal boat repair              
OL,6,FThe Oxfordshire firm explained that the
OL,7,Fdung - which needs to be no older than 
OL,8,Fsix days - would be used to create a   
OL,9,Fwatertight sealant as part of a        
OL,10,F400-year-old boat building technique.  
